# Play test of Halcyon Cove (CIPlay halcyon_cove, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The town on the north plain (3.2 m): the square at 0 50, houses along the street (z 40-64), the cafe at 15.5 45, the
# barber's at -32..-26 55..64, the jetty from 71 north along x -1.5..-3 (deck 1.6 m); the weather tower at 0 30 (deck
# 22 m) and the weather man's hut at 3..7.5 23.5..28 (9.6 m); the moon on the hilltop at -4 2 (12.5 m); the sky wall at
# x 108 (z -15..15), its landing at 98.5..101.5 0..3 (-0.2 m), the door at course 3.8 m, the ledge behind at 108.5..111.
island Halcyon Cove
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Door in the Sky
wait 5
expect animals Chicken 4
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect animals Turtle 2

# Off the jetty into the square (in the rain); the welcome board; the neighbour's script
walk -2.25 80 to -2.25 72 h=1.6
walk -2 66 to -2 54 h=3.2
zone square
expect step 1
expect shown rain
read Welcome board
expect step 2
read Neighbour's script
expect step 3

# The four hidden cameras' tapes (one camera twice: its tape is gone)
use cam1
use cam2
use cam3
use cam4
expect story tape 4
expect step 4
use cam1
expect message Its tape is gone

# The weather tower, the log at its foot, the rain switched off
at 0 30 h=23
zone weathertower
expect step 5
at 5 21.5 h=10
read Weather log
expect step 6
at 0 30 h=23
use rainswitch
expect story boothkey 1
expect step 7
expect hidden rain

# The moon: the booth door, the journal, the console
at -4 2.5 h=13.2
zone moon
expect step 8
read Director's journal
expect step 9
use console
expect story exitkey 1
expect step 10

# The sky wall: the landing, the stair, the door in the sky, the last crate
at 97 1.5 h=0.5
zone skywall
expect step 11
at 106.5 1.5 h=4.3
use skydoor
wait 3
walk 106.8 1.5 to 109.2 1.5 h=3.8
open The last prop crate
expect done

# The other boxes
open Town house cupboard
open Barber's box
open Burger bar fridge
open Sunk prop barrel
